      "fileId": "Main.java",
      "name": "Main.java",
      "content": "public class Main {\n    static int factorial(int n) {\n        if (n <= 1) {\n            return 1;\n        }\n        return n * factorial(n - 1);\n    }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        int result = factorial(5);\n        System.out.println(result);\n    }\n}\n"
    }
